From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:00:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 340/402] Unified: free parts found and said with a video;
 videos past 360 degrees; parts named by their file; the bar for a joint
 picked in the tree
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- AssemblyCopies.free_parts(assembly): each part nudged one way at a time
  and the assembly solved again; a part that stays moved is free (no joint
  holds it). Motion to Video says which parts are free (they stand still
  or jump in the video).
- A video's angle is given within one turn: the joint's angle stops at
  +-360 degrees and a 0-720 degree video stood still past 360.
- A part of another file put into an assembly is called by its file's
  name when its body has the default name (部品004 ... 部品014 said
  nothing).
- A joint picked in the tree gets the bar (Video was found only by
  searching).
(engine field test 0.7.6)

Test: FreeCADCmd -t TestAssemblySolve, -t TestMotionVideo

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
